#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:5 93069ffd2acc481e9098d73a526d42b7
msgid "Optitrack for Non-GPS Navigation"
msgstr "Optitrack 非 GPS 导航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:9 6a6c84aa7b57429980dc029c99a35b6c
msgid ""
"This article explains how a `OptiTrack <https://optitrack.com/>`__ motion "
"capture system can be used as a short-range substitute for a GPS allowing "
"position control modes like Loiter, Guided, RTL, and Auto indoors."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何将 `OptiTrack <https://optitrack.com/>`__ 动作捕捉系统作为 GPS 的短程替代品，以允许在室内使用 "
"Loiter、Guided、RTL 和 Auto 等位置控制模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:13 3e1ab1111d9248aaab401d92f705dacc
msgid ""
"You will need a recent version of ArduPilot on your copter (Copter-4.0 or "
"above)."
msgstr "您需要在多旋翼上使用较新版本的 ArduPilot（Copter-4.0 或以上）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:19 58886d85056a4be3b222aae8548433fa
msgid "Required hardware"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:21 46e8353434894840b3c9259a21956343
msgid ""
"Please refer to OptiTrack `build your own "
"<https://optitrack.com/systems/>`__ tool for all hardware required to setup "
"a motion capture system."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 OptiTrack `自行构建 <https://optitrack.com/systems/>`__ "
"工具，了解搭建动作捕捉系统所需的所有硬件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:25 b7a54d6d39e94c49b5f84570b781b99d
msgid ""
"In order to track the both location and orientation of a drone, you need at "
"least 4 markers."
msgstr "为了同时追踪无人机的位置和姿态，您至少需要 4 个标记点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:29 599613f9ac324c028b9efd86c4f63362
msgid "Motion capture system setup"
msgstr "动作捕捉系统设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:31 d92aebea109042428acade2d02803f12
msgid ""
"Please refer to OptiTrack `quick start guides "
"<https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Quick_Start_Guide:_Getting_Started>`__"
" for hardware and software setup. When you set the ground plane, do not "
"forget to mark the origin and the axis. The positive X will point to the "
"\"north\" of our indoor flight environment (because we do not use compass, "
"it do not need pointing to the real/magnetic north)"
msgstr ""
"请参阅 OptiTrack `快速入门指南 "
"<https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Quick_Start_Guide:_Getting_Started>`__"
" 进行硬件和软件设置。设置地平面时，不要忘记标记原点和轴。正 X 轴将指向我们室内飞行环境的「北方」（因为我们不使用罗盘，它不需要指向真实/磁北方）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:36 16985f792f55414e9b556bdc34747118
msgid "Mark motion capture system coordinate system using tape"
msgstr "用胶带标记动作捕捉系统坐标系"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:40 89372b9cbf28414799875e8cdf9a3177
msgid "Required softwares"
msgstr "所需软件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:42 d3a4a8278f1642b096bc062cc19f8dd9
msgid ""
"`Motive 2 or 3 Tracker <https://optitrack.com/products/motive/tracker/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Motive 2 or 3 Tracker <https://optitrack.com/products/motive/tracker/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:43 c14ee0e4d1a94220b20dffcae73d4c0d
msgid "`MAVProxy <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy>`__"
msgstr "`MAVProxy <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:46 b2091149f1434875a6bcf2a169e06641
msgid "Prepare the drone"
msgstr "准备无人机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:50 3e007e7d2f3445f29dac8866bc96e6e1
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that use small drone for indoor flight and deploy "
"cage in your test flight enviorment."
msgstr "强烈建议在室内飞行时使用小型无人机，并在测试飞行环境中部署防护网。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:54 2d4617558b8f4bc79a95d16c2e223a77
msgid ""
"If you are looking for a small drone for indoor flight test, Skyviper V2450 "
"GPS drone or its successor journey GPS drone is a good choice. It is very "
"affordable and running ArduPilot out-of-box. You can easily flash it wit "
"custom build ArduPilot. If you perfer custom build small drone, there is a "
"very good discuss `here "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/microarducopter-3-props-omnibus-nano-"
"success/32568?u=chobitsfan>`__. The RTF quadcopter frame used in another "
"example video is available from `sdmodel "
"<https://goods.ruten.com.tw/item/show?21806678027603>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果您正在寻找适合室内飞行测试的小型无人机，Skyviper V2450 GPS 无人机或其继任型号 Journey GPS "
"无人机是个不错的选择。它价格实惠，并且开箱即可运行 ArduPilot。您可以轻松将其刷入自定义编译的 ArduPilot "
"固件。如果您更喜欢自制小型无人机，`这里 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/microarducopter-3-props-omnibus-nano-"
"success/32568?u=chobitsfan>`__ 有一个很好的讨论。另一个示例视频中使用的 RTF 四旋翼机架可从 `sdmodel "
"<https://goods.ruten.com.tw/item/show?21806678027603>`__ 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:56 770a2ddfbf684f8086e79ef96b34313c
msgid ""
"First, you need to place markers on the drone. It is very important to place"
" markers so that they form a stereoscopic, asymmetrical shape. Please refer "
"to OptiTrack `rigid body marker placement "
"<https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Rigid_Body_Tracking#Rigid_Body_Marker_Placement>`__"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"首先，您需要在无人机上放置标记点。将标记点放置成立体、非对称形状非常重要。详情请参阅 OptiTrack 的 `rigid body marker "
"placement "
"<https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Rigid_Body_Tracking#Rigid_Body_Marker_Placement>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:61 fc59613135d34495b4cd06f549ee1b1e
msgid "Place markers on the drone"
msgstr "在无人机上放置标记点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:63 1f3cd15048504953932f26e433ef4bea
msgid ""
"Then, put the drone in the ground plane and align it with X axis of motion "
"capture system. The drone should heading to positive X direction."
msgstr "然后，将无人机放在地面上，并与动作捕捉系统的 X 轴对齐。无人机应朝向 X 轴正方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:68 fe89e5947ede4ae480e94f9e484e49d9
msgid "Align the drone with X axis"
msgstr "将无人机与 X 轴对齐"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:70 4c2c0b85c4d2404c9d4ef0c39ffa6c8a
msgid ""
"Select all markers in Motive and create a rigid body from them. Please refer"
" to OptiTrack `creating rigid body "
"<https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Rigid_Body_Tracking#Creating_Rigid_Body>`__"
" for details"
msgstr ""
"在 Motive 中选择所有标记点并从中创建一个刚体。详情请参阅 OptiTrack 的 `creating rigid body "
"<https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Rigid_Body_Tracking#Creating_Rigid_Body>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:73 a9b06cb63f58429e9265e24b657cb11c
msgid "Configuration the drone"
msgstr "配置无人机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:75 ce7df8481d164d908b37ca7f01d4e4d9
msgid ""
"set :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` to 3 , :ref:`EK3_ENABLE "
"<EK3_ENABLE>` to 1 and :ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>` to 0"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` 设置为 3，:ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` "
"设置为 1，:ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>` 设置为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:76 6906bbd475e64146b5048ccfb7af8789
msgid ""
"set :ref:`COMPASS_USE <COMPASS_USE>`, :ref:`COMPASS_USE2 <COMPASS_USE2>`, "
":ref:`COMPASS_USE3 <COMPASS_USE3>` to 0. It prevents ArduPilot from using "
"compass, because there are many sources causing electromagnetic interference"
" in indoor environment."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`COMPASS_USE <COMPASS_USE>`、:ref:`COMPASS_USE2 "
"<COMPASS_USE2>`、:ref:`COMPASS_USE3 <COMPASS_USE3>` 设置为 0。这可防止 ArduPilot "
"使用罗盘，因为室内环境中存在许多电磁干扰源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:77 9660d6a842ad4b0cbee841e9d51d49f3
msgid "set :ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` to 1"
msgstr "将 :ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` 设置为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:78 d76395336f0a4e959d10b78fcab1c87d
msgid ""
"set :ref:`VISO_POS_M_NSE <VISO_POS_M_NSE>` to 0.3 or lower to increase the "
"weighting of position measurements from motion capture system."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`VISO_POS_M_NSE <VISO_POS_M_NSE>` 设置为 0.3 或更低，以增加动作捕捉系统位置测量的权重。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:79 db8374387f6d4478aa6aad96664164ef
msgid "set :ref:`VISO_YAW_M_NSE <VISO_YAW_M_NSE>` to 0.2 or lower"
msgstr "将 :ref:`VISO_YAW_M_NSE <VISO_YAW_M_NSE>` 设置为 0.2 或更低"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:80 5e41b230fe344ef8854041b64e52d235
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` to 6"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` 设置为 6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:81 07025edc2c7e447e84d559d3ccc59eee
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` to 6"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` 设置为 6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:82 d1c803e9038e42d28e76a04c376fc3bc
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` to 6"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` 设置为 6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:83 9ede48879aa64bd9954ed70196df8419
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` to 0"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设置为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:84 4a9dbee6dd4e4cf68792074ca429df01
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` to 0"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` 设置为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:88 9114301b9ba94085bb3371f978d1d678
msgid "Send data to the drone"
msgstr "向无人机发送数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:90 8ea46050cd6e462f96134ba76ffd9103
msgid ""
"Start MAVProxy and connect to your copter. Inside MAVProxy load optitrack "
"module with:"
msgstr "启动 MAVProxy 并连接到您的飞机。在 MAVProxy 中使用以下命令加载 optitrack 模块："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:96 7dc268f21d854683bdb2a769b7328163
msgid ""
"You need to set tracking rigid body id to match your setting in Motive:"
msgstr "您需要设置跟踪刚体 ID 以匹配您在 Motive 中的设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:102 974c31cc02cf4ef5acb37b54523c45b0
msgid ""
"If you set Motive data streaming local interface to other than loopback , it"
" is required to configuare optitrack module with:"
msgstr "如果您将 Motive 数据流的本地接口设置为非回环地址，则需要使用以下命令配置 optitrack 模块："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:112 af10c37dfdae427fbec894170bcdb785
msgid ""
"The coordinate system of both Motive and ArduPilot are right-handed. While Z"
" axis of ArduPilot is pointing down, Y axis of Motive is pointing up."
msgstr "Motive 和 ArduPilot 的坐标系均为右手坐标系。ArduPilot 的 Z 轴朝下，而 Motive 的 Y 轴朝上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:114 c08b39b811a34eb7b067a96387fa0a27
msgid "After all parameters is set, start sending pose to ardupilot:"
msgstr "所有参数设置完成后，开始向 ArduPilot 发送位姿数据："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:121 8f911c6b7db34d04907419a425a1d534
msgid "Ground testing"
msgstr "地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:123 dae8ee07f0414b21b7ed953db75d9af8
msgid "Connect the drone to MAVProxy"
msgstr "将无人机连接到 MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:124 619a7b3ec3d447ed9132c1954a111751
msgid ""
"Start Motive and make sure `data streaming "
"<https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Data_Streaming>`__ is turned"
" on."
msgstr ""
"启动 Motive 并确保 `data streaming "
"<https://v20.wiki.optitrack.com/index.php?title=Data_Streaming>`__ 已开启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:125 1da522680aa247abb617cf133c0f4291
msgid "load and start optitrack module."
msgstr "加载并启动 optitrack 模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:126 18219f4f8da9402698c0d10e2ca2267e
msgid ""
"If you see following message appearing (initial pos may vary), then the "
"drone is receiving pose data from Optitrack system."
msgstr "如果您看到以下消息出现（初始位置可能有所不同），则无人机正在从 Optitrack 系统接收位姿数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:128 0e6adf68a7934f9a9a999afc321fb703
msgid ""
"``EKF3 IMU0 is using external nav data EKF3 IMU0 initial pos NED = "
"0.1,-0.2,0.0 (m) EKF3 IMU0 ext nav yaw alignment complete``"
msgstr ""
"``EKF3 IMU0 is using external nav data EKF3 IMU0 initial pos NED = "
"0.1,-0.2,0.0 (m) EKF3 IMU0 ext nav yaw alignment complete``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:133 e31d05f429ce407da7391f8f05244b73
msgid "Flight testing"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:135 3b4c3c5d9db7489999c903f641567e5e
msgid ""
"Take off in AltHold mode and maintain a stable hover. Switch to Loiter but "
"be ready to switch back to AltHold or Stabilize if the vehicle's position or"
" altitude becomes unstable."
msgstr ""
"在 AltHold 模式下起飞并保持稳定悬停。切换到 Loiter 模式，但如果飞行器的位置或高度变得不稳定，请随时准备切换回 AltHold 或 "
"Stabilize。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:139 179f292e5ae0472bb888f6b1ec45ea9e
msgid ""
"In order to take off in guided or auto mode, you need to use "
"`GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ to set"
" the GPS location of motion capture system origin. It is not need to be "
"accurate, any valid lat/lng is ok."
msgstr ""
"为了在 Guided 或 Auto 模式下起飞，您需要使用 `GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ "
"来设置动作捕捉系统原点的 GPS 位置。不需要精确，任何有效的经纬度均可。"
